{"assets":["/statement-assets/c47d471fc13b9911e37c5760e2edd8458bed754a25a6a5e61a1fa0702deada44.png","/statement-assets/682e6a8e70f7f461957d40033531c1c98f86b37be6316c097e316be3d76da079.png","/statement-assets/c98592c80b6567b33c9726c69fa28f520283a8534e60fe83c90b56fa3083674c.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1336","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Linova and Kingdom"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Writing light novels is the most important thing in Linova's life. Last night, Linova dreamed about a fantastic kingdom. She began to write a light novel for the kingdom as soon as she woke up, and of course, she is the queen of it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c47d471fc13b9911e37c5760e2edd8458bed754a25a6a5e61a1fa0702deada44.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$n$$$ cities and $$$n-1$$$ two-way roads connecting pairs of cities in the kingdom. From any city, you can reach any other city by walking through some roads. The cities are numbered from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$, and the city $$$1$$$ is the capital of the kingdom. So, the kingdom has a tree structure."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"As the queen, Linova plans to choose "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k$$$ cities developing industry, while the other cities will develop tourism. The capital also can be either industrial or tourism city."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A meeting is held in the capital once a year. To attend the meeting, each "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"industry city"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" sends an envoy. All envoys will follow the shortest path from the departure city to the capital (which is unique)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Traveling in tourism cities is pleasant. For each envoy, his "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"happiness"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is equal to the number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tourism cities"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" on his path."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In order to be a queen loved by people, Linova wants to choose $$$k$$$ cities which can maximize the sum of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"happinesses"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of all envoys. Can you calculate the maximum sum for her?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$2\\le n\\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$1\\le k \\lt n$$$)  — the number of cities and industry cities respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$n-1$$$ lines contains two integers $$$u$$$ and $$$v$$$ ($$$1\\le u,v\\le n$$$), denoting there is a road connecting city $$$u$$$ and city $$$v$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that from any city, you can reach any other city by the roads."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the only line containing a single integer  — the maximum possible sum of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"happinesses"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of all envoys."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7 4\n1 2\n1 3\n1 4\n3 5\n3 6\n4 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4 1\n1 2\n1 3\n2 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n8 5\n7 5\n1 7\n6 1\n3 7\n8 3\n2 1\n4 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/682e6a8e70f7f461957d40033531c1c98f86b37be6316c097e316be3d76da079.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, Linova can choose cities $$$2$$$, $$$5$$$, $$$6$$$, $$$7$$$ to develop industry, then the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"happiness"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the envoy from city $$$2$$$ is $$$1$$$, the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"happiness"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of envoys from cities $$$5$$$, $$$6$$$, $$$7$$$ is $$$2$$$. The sum of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"happinesses"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is $$$7$$$, and it can be proved to be the maximum one."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c98592c80b6567b33c9726c69fa28f520283a8534e60fe83c90b56fa3083674c.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, choosing cities $$$3$$$, $$$4$$$ developing industry can reach a sum of $$$3$$$, but remember that Linova plans to choose "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k$$$ cities developing industry, then the maximum sum is $$$2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1336A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1336/problem/A"}